==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
From {{suf|eo|ti-|pos1=demonstrative [[:Category:Esperanto correlatives|correlative]] prefix|am|pos2=correlative suffix of time}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{eo-IPA|a=Eo-tiam.ogg}}

===Adverb===
{{head|eo|adverb|cat2=correlatives}}

# [[then]], at that time (demonstrative correlative of time)

====Usage notes====
When combined with ''[[ĉi]]'', the adverbial particle of proximity, ''tiam ĉi'' means ''[[now]]''.

